order_book_cli: --symbol is for a v1 or v2 file; 'valid/v3_one_instrument.csv' names its own symbols
usage: order_book_cli replay <file.csv> [--trades] [--events] [--book] [--validate none|final|per-command]
                                        [--symbol SYM] [--no-statistics]
       order_book_cli demo
       order_book_cli --help
